==Overview==
''Looking for [[Dual Claw Toilet]] or [[Dual Claw Laser Toilet]]?''

The '''TV Dual Claw Toilet''' is a [[Enemies|enemy]] that have been added on [[Episode 70 Part 2 Update]],he is one of the strongest enemies on [[Hard Mode]]

==Appearance==
The TV Dual Claw Toilet is a grey toilet with 2 dark grey claws with small red dots and a TV Screen with Wheels that make him roll.

==Appearances==

===[[Hard Mode]]===
Wave 37: X4

Wave 50: X1

==Health==

===Hard Mode===
Wave 37: 320,000

Wave 50: 410,500

==Strategy== 

*He has a large amount of HP, so you need units like [[Upgraded Titan Cinemaman]] to stun him or [[Titan Clock Man]] to stop time.
*He stuns units, so you need [[Medic Cameraman]], or [[Camera Repair Drone]], or [[Speaker Repair Drone]] to unstun units

==Trivia== 

*He is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Claw_Car_Skibidi_Toilet#Upgraded_Claw_Car_Skibidi_Toilet Upgraded Claw Car Skibidi Toilet] from the series
*It is the first enemy wearing a TV screen
